cutter (2.5.0-noble2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add the rz-ghidra v0.9.0 and jsdec v0.9.0 decompiler plugins, as in
    Cutter's official builds. We ship both as component tarballs so Launchpad
    can build them offline: rz-ghidra with only the Ghidra decompiler and
    processor specs, and jsdec with its QuickJS subproject.
  * Build-Depend on libpugixml-dev for rz-ghidra.

